# Normalize line endings: store all text as LF regardless of platform.
# Without this, Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true rewrite LF
# files to CRLF on disk, causing `git status` to flag every text file
# as modified. `format:check` (bun run format:check) keys off that
# flag and fails spuriously on Windows. `* text=auto` lets Git still
# detect binary files; `eol=lf` overrides the user-level autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf